<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Orbit / Visual Identity System</title>
<style>
  :root { --ink:#1b1b1f; --paper:#f5f2ec; --accent:#3d5afe; }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
  html, body { height: 100%; }
  body {
    background: var(--paper); color: var(--ink);
    font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
    min-height: 100vh; display: flex; flex-direction: column;
  }
  header, footer {
    display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;
    padding: 24px 48px; font-family: "Helvetica Neue", Arial, sans-serif;
    font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: .14em; text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  main { flex: 1; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; padding: 0 48px; }
  .tagline { font-family: "Helvetica Neue", Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; max-width: 520px; margin-bottom: 40px; line-height: 1.5; }
  .kicker { font-family: "Helvetica Neue", Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: .14em; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 16px; color: var(--accent); }
  h1 { font-weight: 400; font-size: clamp(56px, 12vw, 160px); line-height: .95; letter-spacing: -.02em; }
  h1 em { font-style: italic; color: var(--accent); }
  .orbit { position: absolute; right: -120px; top: 50%; transform: translateY(-50%); width: 420px; height: 420px; border: 1px solid var(--ink); border-radius: 50%; opacity: .25; pointer-events: none; }
  .orbit::after { content: ""; position: absolute; width: 14px; height: 14px; background: var(--accent); border-radius: 50%; top: -7px; left: 50%; }
  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    header, footer { padding: 20px; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; }
    main { padding: 0 20px; }
    .orbit { display: none; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
  <header><span>Orbit</span><span>Visual Identity System</span></header>
  <main>
    <div class="orbit"></div>
    <p class="kicker">Orbit / Visual Identity System</p>
    <h1>Room for<br>everything<br><em>you&rsquo;re into.</em></h1>
    <p class="tagline" style="margin-top:40px">A visual identity shaped by curiosity, connection, and clear organization.</p>
  </main>
  <footer><span>Jaylan Birdsong</span><span>Orbit</span></footer>
</body>
</html>
